*DISCRIPCTION OF TASK2* = # Sales Forecasting using Machine Learning
This project is a Machine Learning-based Sales Forecasting system that predicts future sales using historical sales data. The main goal of the project is to analyze weekly sales trends and generate accurate future sales predictions to help businesses make better decisions.
The project uses Python and Machine Learning algorithms to process sales data, train models, compare performance, and forecast future revenue. Historical sales data is first cleaned and converted into weekly data using Pandas. Several important features such as transaction count, average discount, quantity sold, lag values, and rolling averages are created to improve prediction accuracy.
Three Machine Learning models are used in this project:
* Random Forest Regressor
* Gradient Boosting Regressor
* Linear Regression
The dataset is divided into training and testing data using a time-aware split method. Each model is trained and evaluated using performance metrics like:
* MAE (Mean Absolute Error)
* RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error)
* R² Score
The best-performing model is automatically selected based on the R² score. After selecting the best model, the system predicts sales for the next 12 weeks using recursive forecasting.
This project also creates a professional dashboard using Matplotlib. The dashboard includes:
* Historical sales trend
* Model comparison chart
* Actual vs predicted sales graph
* 12-week future sales forecast
* Feature importance analysis
The forecasted results are exported as a CSV file, and the dashboard is saved as an image for easy visualization and reporting.
Technologies used in this project include:
* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Scikit-learn
This project helps beginners understand important Machine Learning concepts such as:
* Time series forecasting
* Feature engineering
* Regression models
* Data visualization
* Model evaluation
Overall, this project demonstrates how Machine Learning can be used in business analytics to predict future sales trends and support smart decision-making.
